        "text": "The listener is a member of the Democratic party or closely involved in its legislative processes.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that knowing the current status of the legislation is important for decision-making or public understanding.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener attended the morning meeting with Democratic leaders.",
