        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Meaningful inclusion of progressive priorities depends on binding commitments from moderate senators.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "A formal reconciliation framework would increase predictability and legitimacy in the legislative process.",
        "confidence": 0.9
