    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "on the border. Of course, this has been a subject matter that has dominated a lot of this year, but recently we've seen Title 42 being upheld in the courts. We're also seeing a lot of these Haitian immigrants, migrants who are now being bussed to certain facilities near the border. What is currently your point of view on what is happening and what still needs to be done by the administration?",
